        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>地域文化视域下旅游文创产品设计研究</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #ececec;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 765px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 39px 45px 16px;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .topline {\n    height: 24px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    line-height: 11px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .issue { position: absolute; left: 1px; top: 0; }\n  .journal { position: absolute; left: 171px; top: 0; text-align: center; width: 94px; }\n  .journal b { font-size: 9px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n  .page-no { position: absolute; right: 2px; bottom: 1px; font-size: 7px; }\n  .notes {\n    height: 38px;\n    position: relative;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .blob {\n    position: absolute;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    height: 27px;\n    padding: 0 12px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .b1 { left: 2px; top: 6px; background: #bfeeed; transform: rotate(-8deg); }\n  .b2 { left: 88px; top: 0; background: #fff19b; transform: rotate(-10deg); }\n  .b3 { left: 171px; top: 1px; background: #ffd5d8; transform: rotate(3deg); }\n  .b4 { left: 247px; top: 1px; background: #c7efd8; transform: rotate(-4deg); }\n  .b5 { left: 318px; top: 2px; background: #ffd7d9; transform: rotate(2deg); }\n  .b6 { right: 1px; top: 0; background: #f7d4d9; transform: rotate(-5deg); }\n  h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 25px;\n    letter-spacing: .2px;\n  }\n  .author {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  sup { font-size: 6px; vertical-align: super; font-weight: normal; }\n  .affiliation {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    line-height: 14px;\n    margin-top: 1px;\n  }\n  .cn-abstract {\n    margin: 12px 12px 0;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    line-height: 12px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .cn-abstract p { margin: 0; }\n  .key { font-weight: bold; }\n  .mark-green {\n    border: 2px solid #00c927;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    padding: 0 1px;\n  }\n  .mark-pink {\n    background: #ffd4e7;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 -5px 0 #ffd4e7;\n  }\n  .mark-yellow { background: #fff599; }\n  .mark-cyan { background: #bff3f3; }\n  .english {\n    margin-top: 25px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #333;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 8px 13px 8px;\n  }\n  .en-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    line-height: 15px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .en-author {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-top: 7px;\n  }\n  .en-aff {\n    font-size: 7.3px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 10px;\n    margin: 3px 8px 9px;\n  }\n  .en-abstract {\n    font-size: 7.4px;\n    line-height: 9.5px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .en-abstract p { margin: 0; }\n  .en-keywords {\n    margin-top: 3px !important;\n    font-size: 7.4px;\n  }\n  .foot {\n    font-size: 7.5px;\n    line-height: 12px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .foot p { margin: 0; }\n  .copyright {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 13px;\n    left: 18px;\n    right: 18px;\n    color: #929292;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"topline\">\n    <div class=\"issue\">第 44 卷　第 2 期</div>\n    <div class=\"journal\"><b>包 装 工 程</b><br>PACKAGING ENGINEERING</div>\n    <div class=\"page-no\">339</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"notes\">\n    <span class=\"blob b1\">观点</span>\n    <span class=\"blob b2\">观点</span>\n    <span class=\"blob b3\">名词</span>\n    <span class=\"blob b4\">案例</span>\n    <span class=\"blob b5\">措施</span>\n    <span class=\"blob b6\">问题</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1>地域文化视域下旅游文创产品设计研究</h1>\n  <div class=\"author\">郭继业 <sup>1,2</sup></div>\n  <div class=\"affiliation\">\n    （1.内蒙古师范大学　国际设计艺术学院，呼和浩特 010020；<br>\n    2.内蒙古自治区创新设计与社会创新高校人文社科重点研究基地，呼和浩特 010020）\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cn-abstract\">\n    <p><span class=\"key\">摘要：</span><span class=\"mark-green\">目的</span> 探索旅游文创产品地域文化的涵养下所迸发的各种设计形式与创新方法。<span class=\"mark-green\">方法</span> 从地域文化、主题性和时代的跨步性传承发展着手，其中的精华元素和文化艺术设计都融入可贵的综合色彩创新方法。本文主要基于这一现实观察，<span class=\"mark-yellow\">从文创产品设计的应用与发展视角出发，提出地域文化和地方旅游文化资源的融合可能，并对两者结合的重要性做出概述</span>，以<span class=\"mark-pink\">旅游者的文化体验和情感</span>，区以旅游旅游文创产品设计的延续性。<span class=\"mark-cyan\">在需要科学思考，探索对文化、功能、情感等层面的有效应用与创新。</span><span class=\"mark-green\">结论</span> 地域文化视域下旅游文创产品设计应对地区丰富的内涵和文化内涵进行深入的审美观，并以大范围的学科整合，<span class=\"mark-pink\">发掘设计者的基础创意，构建人们产品、文化的完美链接</span>，以丰富旅游特有的审美文化产品和旅游的社会效果。</p>\n    <p><span class=\"key\">关键词：</span>地域文化；文化产品；创意</p>\n    <p>中图分类号：TB472　　文献标识码：A　　文章编号：1001-3563(2023)02-0339-04</p>\n    <p>DOI：10.19554/j.cnki.1001-3563.2023.02.040</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"english\">\n    <div class=\"en-title\">Design of Tourism Cultural and Creative Products from the<br>Perspective of Regional Culture</div>\n    <div class=\"en-author\">GUO Ji-ye<sup>1,2</sup></div>\n    <div class=\"en-aff\">\n      (1.International Design Art College, Inner Mongolia Normal University, Hohhot 010020, China;<br>\n      2.Design and Social Innovation Key Research Base of Humanities and Social Sciences of Inner<br>\n      Mongolia Universities, Hohhot 010020, China)\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"en-abstract\">\n      <p><b>ABSTRACT:</b> The work aims to explore various design forms and innovative methods of tourism cultural and creative products under the nourishment of regional culture. The regional culture of China has been inherited and developed with the pace of the times, the essence of which has given valuable experience and new inspiration to the field of culture, art and design. Based on the reality of this development background, the possibility of integrating regional culture elements into design of tourism cultural and creative products was put forward from the application and development perspective of product design. With the combination of these two important values as the basis, the design ideas of tourism cultural and creative products, such as exploring elements, determining audiences and enriching categories, were put forward. The effective application and innovation in levels such as culture, function and emotion were discussed. Design of tourism cultural and creative products from the perspective of regional culture should cater to the modern aesthetics with rich connotation and cultural attributes. In addition, it should also highlight the unique creativity of designers and construct a perfect combination of people, products and culture with people's daily life and regional culture as the main reference, so as to achieve good social effect with rich and unique tourism cultural and creative products.</p>\n      <p class=\"en-keywords\"><b>KEY WORDS:</b> regional culture; cultural and creative products; originality</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"foot\">\n    <p>收稿日期：2022-08-20</p>\n    <p>基金项目：内蒙古自治区社会科学规划项目（2017NDB088）；内蒙古科教产学研专项地方科技发展专项资金计划项目（2019-1229）</p>\n    <p>作者简介：郭继业（1976—），女，硕士，教授，主要研究方向为视觉传达设计。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"copyright\">(C) 1994-2023 China Academic Journal Electronic Publishing House. All rights reserved.　 http://www.cnki.net</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
